message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "BiblioTR: an open-source toolkit for harvesting, validating and exporting records from Türkiye's national citation index"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit and web interface that harvests publication records from TR Dizin,
  Türkiye's national citation index, stores them in SQLite, runs bibliometric analyses
  and exports them to Web of Science plain text, RIS, BibTeX and VOSviewer formats for use
  with Bibliometrix/Biblioshiny, VOSviewer and reference managers.
